0. Important
                             * IMPORTANT NOTE *

   This program is derived from the Xenolink version XFSERV. All Xeno
   specific routines have been removed. Traplist library support is now
   default.


   Also note, that you will now require CR's at the end of your header,
   template and footer txt files, as the internally generated CR's have
   been removed. Please check the examples in the config directory.


   It is not required that you close down ZFSmanager after altering the
   config file. Autonotify is now used to re-read the config file when
   you save it.

   Most strings are also definable, please read the relevent section in
   this doc, and the supplied ZFServ.config for more information.

1.0. Introduction 

    This is ZFServ, a file request handler for Zeus Professional  
   Bulletin Board System. Because other available request servers 
    do not have all options which ZFServ could have, we 
   (Martin Wasley and Bart Schraa) decided to write our own one. 

   ZFServ is designed as two seperate utilities, the ZFServManager 
   which is the "managertask" running in the background and ZFTell 
   which can send a message to ZFServManager's messageport. Currently 
   this is an ordinary messageport, but it will be converted to a 
   ARexx messageport, which will make things easier. 
 
 
2.0. Features 
 
       * superlative reliability 
 
       * especially written for AmigaDOS Release 2 and above 
  
       * Uses SAS/C 6.51 instruction scheduler for increased performance on 
         the 68040 
 
       * ZFTell is fully reentrant, that means that you can make it resident
         without a hassle. 
 
       * full support for 4D addresses. 
 
       * high quality performance 
 
       * support for CDROM's 
 
       * extremely fast scanning 
 
 
3.0. System Hardware and Software Requirements 
 
       * Commodore Amiga ® 
 
       * AmigaDOS Release 2 or higher 
 
       * Zeus Professional Bulletin Board System. 
 
